## 4. Pipeline Confirmed

The walkthrough explains the combined audited runtime thread:

```text
write meaning
resolve meaning
candidate only
generate candidate vector
deterministic AVF score
ranked review report
GT/LGT review required
Root remains final authority
```

The walkthrough is explanatory only. It does not create a new runtime
integration layer, authority layer, production DRS, production AVF, GT/LGT
implementation, Root behavior, public WOW, or whitepaper.

